{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "32bd6cdd-d836-8e32-af51-5ecc944cd4f3",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T10:43:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I'm calling about a fence. I want to put one up and I'm not sure what I need to do first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Can I get your name and the address where the fence would go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Theresa Lombardozzi. It's 449 Kingston Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Theresa. Tell me a little about the fence. What kind and how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so, a white picket style. Four feet. Well, I think four feet is what they call standard. Is that right? How do I know that's even allowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four feet in the front or side yard is pretty common. Is the fence going across the front, or around the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, mostly the back and along one side. My neighbor built a new deck and now they can look right down into my yard. So I want some privacy. Although, a picket fence isn't very private, is it? [pause] I guess that's a different problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, a picket fence does mark the boundary, but you can see through it, yes. Let's start with the permit question and we can talk about the style after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So, do I need a permit for a fence? Yes or no. Because my cousin said no, you just put it up, and my friend said yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually needs a permit in the city, and in the Historic Hill area there can be extra review on top of that. I'd want to look at your property to tell you exactly which applies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, extra review? Why would there be extra review? How do I know that applies to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Because parts of the Hill are in a historic district, and exterior changes can get looked at more closely. I can check whether 449 Kingston is in it while we're talking. Give me a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. So I'm seeing that it would go through a review, and I'd want you to send in a simple sketch showing where the fence goes, how tall it is, and the material."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Like, I draw it myself? On paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a simple drawing is fine. Your lot, the house, and a line where the fence runs, with the height marked. A photo of the style you like helps too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the sketch, the height, and a picture. And that's a permit, not just a letter or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, an application for a permit. The sketch goes with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And how long does it take? Because I'd like to get it done, and I'm, [line breaks up] sorry, I'm in the car, I'll pull over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. How long does approval take? Days? Weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be a couple of weeks, sometimes longer if it needs the historic review. I can't promise an exact date, but if the sketch is clear and complete, it goes faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. Or longer. Okay. So I shouldn't call a fence guy yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd hold off on scheduling the install until the permit is in hand, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, because I'm raising my granddaughter, and now I'm back to scheduling around school pickup times, so I can't be waiting around for people. I have to know when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Once you apply, the office can tell you where it stands. Would you like the form emailed, or would you rather pick it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Which one's faster? Is it the same form either way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same form. Email is quicker, and you can send the application back that way too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, then email. Wait, do you need my number too, in case?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0195. I'll note that you're at 449 Kingston Avenue asking about a four-foot picket fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:42:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four feet, white picket, back and one side. And the permit's required. I just want to be sure I have that right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Yes, you need a permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:43:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
